OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 JUN
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Musicians on the Couch
OL,5,     GHow does music affect the mind?
OL,6,     GWriter Amanda Dalton considers
OL,7,     Ghow music can reach people when
OL,8,     Gnothing else can, inspired by
OL,9,     GMargart Tilly, music therapist
OL,10,     Gand concert pianist.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GSoweto is joined once again by
OL,19,     GChicago-based cellist and
OL,20,     Gcomposer Tomeka Reid, as she
OL,21,     Greturns with a third selection
OL,22,     Gfrom her collection.
